"[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Sanford Stem Cell Institute Seminar Series: Sohail Tavazoie, MD, PhD\",\n    \"description\": \"Mark your calendars for our next speaker in our Sanford Stem Cell Institute Seminar Series! Sohail Tavazoie, MD, PhD, will be at the Sanford Consortium for Regenerative Medicine* on Thursday, December 10 in Duane Roth Auditorium from 9:30–10:30 a.m. PT to speak on Cancer Metastasis as a Heritable Trait Shaped by our Evolutionary Exposure to Infectious Disease. Join us on the terrace for refreshments before the event. *Parking will be enforced Learning Objectives: At the conclusion of the activity, the participants will be able to: Treat patients with stem cells more effectively as a result of multidisciplinary discussionDisseminate the latest research and clinical advances on stem cells and regenerative medicine to promote improved strategies and methodologiesPromote further investigation into topics involving stem cells and regenerative medicineTranslate stem cell and regenerative medicine research from bench to bedside Accreditation Statement: The University of California San Diego School of Medicine is accredited by the Accreditation Council for Continuing Medical Education to provide continuing medical education for physicians. The University of California San Diego School of Medicine designates this live activity for a maximum of 1 AMA PRA Category 1 Credit™. Physicians should only claim the credit commensurate with the extent of their participation in the activity.\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-12-10\",\n    \"start_time\": \"09:30\",\n    \"end_time\": \"10:30\",\n    \"location\": \"Sanford Consortium for Regenerative Medicine\",\n    \"address\": \"2880 Torrey Pines Scenic Drive\",\n    \"provides_food\": true,\n    \"is_free\": true,\n    \"food_description\": \"refreshments\",\n    \"eligibility\": null,\n    \"registration_url\": \"https://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/sanford-stem-cell-institute-seminar-series-sohail-tavazoie-md-phd#tickets=1\",\n    \"event_url\": \"https://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/sanford-stem-cell-institute-seminar-series-sohail-tavazoie-md-phd\",\n    \"source_url\": \"https://calendar.ucsd.edu/student-life\",\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"title\": \"Sanford Stem Cell Institute Seminar Series: Sohail Tavazoie, MD, PhD\",\n      \"date\": \"December 10\",\n      \"time\": \"9:30–10:30 a.m.\",\n      \"location\": \"Sanford Consortium for Regenerative Medicine\",\n      \"provides_food\": \"Join us on the terrace for refreshments before the event.\",\n      \"is_free\": \"0.0 | USD | https://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/sanford-stem-cell-institute-seminar-series-sohail-tavazoie-md-phd#tickets=1\",\n      \"food_description\": \"refreshments\",\n      \"eligibility\": null\n    }\n  }\n]"
